  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25c4449662e70dd66505d784",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "女王将在秋季舞台上挑战最后一冠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8122ecb8e5effecf4f51b10080c513618296c5f9e28ba20a7c49da9176641a95",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2959"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6de58acfe03bb18b5ce7b46d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太好了！　%h_rank_ta1完美获胜！\n终于称霸了荣耀的德比！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28f9e6146a80ceb83488adc24d4a27eb65841090e6115351457a7849dcff55f7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "296"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a77c4a534eb4716d80c203",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "她能否在菊之舞台\n夺得最后一冠！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7567a6238bacade0bb8fa4ab05df2c1e417341c362b6a67d08475aea946a314",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2960"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11053c77dee6c1d649ced247",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "以夺得最高荣誉的奔跑\n瞄准最后一冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf623d8453b357fd83eaea60b33a2f3ef6f8b49337359fb7fc22923f982772e6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2961"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5836524afa0cd4bc7d08fa7d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "年轻的王者能用实力证明自己吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c5b2e4b9d0bab66eb5eb2ae7d146563610a5a0537c96032cdd0ada624ffc47",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2962"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e8c761bd455a4c3c5ff8b97",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "以身经百战的优骏为对手，\n去争夺现役最强的宝座吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb079bcedaf3c16005b12c5639d0863fa1eb0e152de8c6ae46a00e3b48dd3c46",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2963"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b60ec0758c099d682ba2cc6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "她能否达成春秋连霸呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ac4fe49cc65333fe9ee47fe9ad7a6e583254e92c0ac03656aae524f91706b1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2964"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d240714290a07754dccda725",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "她做好了万全准备前来挑战连霸",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2241b7e4142e5c0da226e41b32c08734bf3d1d1d827f72965ab76c61857a6a0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2965"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e10b58745a9a62f82c762107",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，精彩地达成了三冠！\n在这里，最强的赛马娘诞生了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8559a33f6a630acfbf8f8b85ba10b2304135006497f07bee962104763276e491",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2966"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4965ed13b6c69e7c41fbef2d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，秋季三冠达成！\n在秋季GⅠ战线取胜\n成功名垂青史！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1259aa439aa0e8a4f49a76d1df42c66d7dfafbcffb11fe5dab7ddbb9c7371097",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2967"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c3da76eff4d8339a9eda96c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，终于达成了三冠！\n赢得了史上最强女王的宝座\n永恒的女主角诞生了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d878615f130f5b71a0f8dd34a4ba534a2e7f234efe63971a10ccc6ac9de7678e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2968"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df09fe9b443833e3c13d1bf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，达成了春季三冠！\n击退了所有强敌，达成了伟业",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a6be6789f5ec0fbdc3e9a389394f501d81da0b4cf3404045e1643645b883bb8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2969"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:472e51f50d57fcf41b388b80",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank1，获得胜利！\n上半年的英里女王宝座\n属于%h_rank_ta1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad4ec4ed22af6dc2b4aa0aebc34b4a439e5f4223e4555939e3850cb5b28165be",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "297"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6141bdc2651cd9e06f7ebdf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "天皇赏，春・秋连霸！\n完成了历史性壮举的是这位马娘\n%h_rank_l1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "817c548e3712920da2cb4b6dd9404dff22ef96831c3c8795aa4deaf392650670",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2970"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60b35803d411d2e01b4605e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，制霸了两场大奖赛！\n完美证明了自己最强的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65bfab8177c23c8656450bc249915e1f095a5626da3067bc89ec06cd782d3e72",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2971"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87e6ed423b9f226cf97345f6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，制霸了两大英里赛！\n成功登上了英里界的顶点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88fd951f54fca4a3a2ba1e758b911b460a53480175ea8451385d63ba0dbb1f51",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2972"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab37730888f2e60ff139367",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，制覇了两大短途赛！\n现役最速赛马娘在这里诞生了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "934893557d50453975b9edfdb79782b7079de873f61aef31e53a07b9a48529ad",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2973"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c4d05a6664bffa2497bbe7f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，制霸了两大沙土战！\n精彩地登上了最强沙土赛马娘的宝座！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ef0321bfe5c1d00bafc0875c882953ab82b182c8553d99ddd2e93847f75a48",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2974"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65e5a9f2faea4b65a6f7189",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，制霸德比，达成双冠！\n传说将在秋季的京都被传颂下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdef7d0195e0d9430013c876ba2016ddbde274ddda4f631aa3a8be06a89810cf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2975"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c21531a05c98149c7f23fcc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\n继樱花赏之后又在橡树大赛中制胜\n双冠赛马娘在这里，诞生了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aace1d9493404503ba7971b2af15a4980f74c16747d514d3c2016b368c1da768",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2976"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a5141f5e2f34c866c5109c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%horse1此时突破了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe8d61fa7f98e993e6dd07666e286bb4cca32647169548cfec561d91c7d8ec5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2977"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b182df1a04a9d76b7962d8e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank2\n位于第二名，正在观察局势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "099831d5d951060ef6ea2cf44deff9e10bb111ad7c60b137ba313e5ac04f203d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2978"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6122523ab9768689d742950",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "仿佛在紧盯着前方\n%a_h_rank3",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc5092db6811ee395579cecb6979e00ae0c38a0f9c3c5c97475fd50235152a3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2979"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b192e2a61d159bf64371aefa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "漂亮！　成功夺得\n宝冢主角的是%h_rank_ta1！\n梦想化为了现实！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01880a2e340662c39e6ea11d4a7f26197bdc4f7c2df94ec7b6165e8820e6d958",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "298"
      ]
    },
