      "source_text": "%h_rank_ta1称霸了这场激烈的闪电战！\n短途马锦标，完胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6dee96289995ca206099eeaad01375bf1be9247ef0851d3a20a7cba7dfd19eb",
