    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4615334274a8d96f6d8f915a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在星空之下举行，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "65f4c645a2481bcd3980bec0a6e341fb2d6f2830ee5f777ce6aa04e22d972d75",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "2999"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:426e35c77a4c3162f9beb5f7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在令脚底泥泞的大雨中，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "73647efca18d1a81d6cdb62885806ad4813d0a79a8e503d05638f32293ba81c4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15a735000d70cead22ef72fc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "独一无二，赌上一面坚盾的热血战斗！\n最长距离GⅠ天皇赏（春）！",
      "source_fingerprint": "799389c7d49dad9d4bc5bd9483fd2c5e2b42f1510e897f16a6768e0494a8a992",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c1727ec1dca734f2a2ab81",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "秋之京都女王降临！\n%h_rank_l1！　完美称霸秋华赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f9d92fe17e91e1b8d64403ce5e84d8069e93020ad864631abdf05bfa251c579",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:481eb397620f2e938d20e05f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "笼罩夜空的乌云营造了紧张氛围\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9fa9d4c6f3bc3f34d12c77eede9a1bf25889c2c9b0992ca09775520842cca11",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b589555971e96e1c653a010",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "雨点在光照下闪闪发光，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ae640e265f2ba5c1fe3f47b4ba3cfd6ce91c0ad5fbb5d1574fc081bf2040964",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d721911a934802537d384068",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "夜雨使人有一种动荡不安的预感，\n%course%ground%distance\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "45acf7271f2e9bfb1906f8bb2eaa32aa2e9d4bd98e25d1a9ed94655896d10c38",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084ebc03aaf7257d56af5119",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\n%race_wo！\n距离顶点还差一步！　决胜的时刻到了",
      "source_fingerprint": "211e6f97e9357fbc892be74a5bb6bbe2648706c2b5806cce93d86dca59695ade",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa53375e7a04090764147c8e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\n%race_wo！\n此时此刻，优骏的顶点诞生了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd9c204362f1fb5da1b76abac2ccc098bd4ea62dbc8b67a2b78779d7df2c52aa",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f34b97104df55ac9ba08ce55",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "团队比赛开始了！\n重要的第一战，谁将连结胜利的纽带！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4380134d2a0cf92c3506a08dfe00e4f002393030ea4100131fff44f57a630a29",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b6402b3ab0e7e862af0cfd4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "脱离降级圈的重要一步，\n能迈出这步的是哪位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6cbdd51d46ba93651a4db224ed1f9b86fa9a7d742f5fa4a8783c5df57d4f08",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1db2a8bf6cae9dde4203866",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "根据第一场比赛的结果踏入第二场比赛，\n各赛马娘背负着队伍的希望进行挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db978b526e1aec3b1d8f0533f7c6880acb913f88e29b948eed72c2f94f64a9e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf147f243a9548a82ec9697",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜利纽带能继续连结下去吗！\n大家对第二场比赛的期待愈发高涨！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2888bcd88ac9517417d92c9f09827bd7f4673653e03bc7caeda7b26bad597a2c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d812f12fd6d8a3c32e0ea76a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第二场比赛要开始了\n心中怀着悔恨，\n能够一雪第一场比赛的耻辱吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e49e44eff15848ba09c4f4afd858312051ee8780d66a3e00e839d405024e18",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57c764df6b94d8a59a91f9e7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！\n在菊之舞台精彩地斩获了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8565db60e10e8df045a35c0202d68bb2d718decefa030314584260778dbee213",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8491a682ce0119b03b78e7f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "作为转折点的第三场比赛\n不管怎样都要拿到好结果\n迎接下半段比赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e79bd573834b7ee3fde7982732c3e4260ddfd8e9fba159e5970cbf89d95ea44",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8762ba06b376448b91c82f78",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "目前仍有一支队伍未尝一败\n观众们的期待愈发高涨！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71f21daa539ad9cf243290c109639f75096b5b22aec77780d7185dc0b06c3c9f",
