    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862dce4b0117e0eeb64fd077",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "终于来到最后的大舞台，第五场比赛！\n胸怀着全队坚持至此的希望，\n她们能抓住荣光吗，决胜时刻到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a1ee6009f0932806ad45660d6460bd84d903c9994e979efdb17e489da7ffdf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:700c290b4b8fd46a5d7f72a0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "竟然有至今为止全胜的队伍！\n能够成就伟业吗！\n最终决战，要上了！",
